; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - index mean-reversion sleeve for the OANDA index CFD DEMO account (chapter 100).
; Same settings as AMS_Sleeves_Index.set, plus InpIxEquityOffset=2500000.
; Why: the demo account holds 3,000,000 JPY, but every test in reports/experiments.md used 500,000 JPY.
;   With 3,000,000 JPY the same settings also hold the small positions that a 500,000 JPY account cannot (minimum lot sizes),
;   so the risk is about twice that of the tests (3 years, real ticks: +244% with a 30% drawdown instead of +166% with 16%).
;   With the offset, positions and limits are computed from (equity - 2,500,000), i.e. from 500,000 JPY plus profits and losses,
;   and the Strategy Tester reproduces the 500,000 JPY results (run 730: +825,390 JPY vs +828,569 JPY).
; If the demo balance is different, set InpIxEquityOffset = balance - 500000. To use the whole balance instead,
;   use AMS_Sleeves_Index.set with a smaller InpIxRevUnitVol (see chapter 100, section 6).
InpEntryMode=8
InpIxRevSymbols=US500,US100,US30
InpIxTrendSymbols=none
InpIxRuleR2=true
InpIxRuleD7=true
InpIxRuleIBS=true
InpIxRevUnitVol=8.75
InpIxTrendUnitVol=0.0
InpIxTrendCheckDays=7
InpIxMaxLev=10.0
InpIxBand=0.25
InpIxSLVolMul=4.0
InpIxVolModel=1
InpIxVixFile=AMS_vix.csv
InpIxVixLowMult=0.5
InpIxVixHighMult=1.5
InpIxRuleWeights=1,2,4
InpIxSoGuard=0.9
InpIxFlatMinutes=0
InpIxFlatEdgeBp=0.0
InpIxDelayMin=5
InpIxMaxSpreadPct=0.05
InpMaxMarginUsePct=90.0
InpIxJointRound=false
InpIxJointEps=0.25
InpIxWarmStart=true
InpIxRegimeDays=1500
InpIxRegimeThr=1.0
InpIxRegimeRef=US500
InpIxDryRun=false
InpIxEquityOffset=2500000
